<title>THAILAND: Bank of Thailand says reference rate 29.967.</title>
<headline>Bank of Thailand says reference rate 29.967.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand on Wednesday said that the weighted average interbank exchange rate was 29.967 per dollar against 30.348 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The reference rate is the average rate traded the previous day. It has been announced daily by the central bank since the July 2 managed flotation of the baht.</p>
<p>The baht was quoted at 29.95/29.97 to the dollar onshore and 29.75/29.90 in offshore markets early.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
